        "original_id": "36fd7b06-88d7-56d0-8e70-ebfc33112017",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Tommy Gunn toy, Sterling submachine gun, Sten gun, L85A1 assault rifle\n- Roles: British infantry soldier\n- Topics: World War II, military equipment\n\nFacts:\n- The Tommy Gunn toy’s basic doll depicted a British infantry soldier equipped with a Sterling submachine gun.\n- The Tommy Gunn toy was also sold in a World War II version carrying a Sten gun.\n- The Sterling submachine gun remained in use until 1994.\n- In 1994, the Sterling submachine gun was phased out as the L85A1 assault rifle was phased in.",
